Buzz test songs for tests/m3/buzz_decode.sh (bbmp_buzz module, I710d). Never committed: fetched by sha256 into the git-ignored
tests/m3/fixtures/.cache. No redistribution licence is stated for the songs. The first two use only BmxPlay's machines and play; the
third needs the Windows plug-in "And XGEN" and must be refused.
